# Respond in English

Write every agent-authored message in English, even when the user writes in Spanish or another language.

## Always English

- Chat replies, plans, status updates, and explanations of code, diffs, and errors
- Code comments, commit messages, and pull-request text that you write
- New entries in DECISIONS.md
- Edits to AGENTS.md, CODE_QUALITY.md, DECISIONS.md, and MCP_USAGE.md

Do not answer in the prompt's language and then add an English translation. English only.

## Leave unchanged unless asked

- Product UI and user-facing copy already in the project (Spanish or bilingual strings, labels, i18n catalogs)
- Identifiers, file names, and existing code
- Existing comments and historical text you are not already editing
- Tool output, logs, and quoted errors — explain them in English; do not rewrite the quote

Before writing code, follow AGENTS.md, and CODE_QUALITY.md, DECISIONS.md, and MCP_USAGE.md when they exist.
